### 79.8 literal parsing
$ incrby jj +5    => ERR value is not an integer or out of range
$ incrby jj 05    => ERR value is not an integer or out of range
$ incrby jj -0    => ERR value is not an integer or out of range
$ incrbyfloat ff 1.5d     => ERR value is not a valid float
$ incrbyfloat ff " 1.5 "  => ERR value is not a valid float
$ incrbyfloat ff .5       => 0.5      (ACCEPTED by redis — do not over-reject)
$ incrbyfloat ff 1e3      => 1000.5   (ACCEPTED by redis — do not over-reject)
$ incrbyfloat ff inf      => ERR increment would produce NaN or Infinity
$ incrbyfloat ff nan      => ERR value is not a valid float

